/* ============================================================
   Wave Survived.

   Was a raised Gilded Vigil plate carrying a list; is now two words.
   The panel existed because type alone could not hold its own against
   fire fields, corpses and lit ground — with the list gone, a heavy
   shadow does that job and the arena the player just cleared stays
   visible behind it.

   The gold is the TUTORIAL's gold (rgb(244,170,54)) rather than the
   old panel's paler rgb(240,205,120): this is the game's own voice
   speaking over the field, the same one the wave banner and the
   tutorial use, and it should sound like them.
   ============================================================ */

.ws-overlay {
    flex-grow: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
}

.ws-title {
    font-size: 46px;
    -unity-font-definition: url("Fonts/Alegreya-Bold.ttf");
    -unity-font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 6px;
    color: rgb(244, 170, 54);
    -unity-text-align: middle-center;
    white-space: normal;
    max-width: 90%;
    /* Doing the work the panel used to do. */
    text-shadow: 2px 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95);
}
